name: sim.scheduleExecution
description: Schedules execution of a function
luaSynopsis: int id = sim.scheduleExecution(func f, list args, float timePoint, bool simTime = False)
pythonSynopsis: int id = sim.scheduleExecution(func f, any[] args, float timePoint, bool simTime = false)
inputs:
1. f: function to call
2. args: arguments to the function
3. timePoint: time when the function should execute
4. simTime: simulation or real-time scheduling
outputs:
1. id: id of the scheduled execution function
